OL,3,GNEWSAAsda launches petrol station
OL,4,Ainvestigation after car issues reported
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda is investigating after some
OL,7,Fmotorists said their vehicles had
OL,8,Fdeveloped problems after they filled up
OL,9,Fat one of the supermarket chain's
OL,10,Fpetrol stations in Northern Ireland.
OL,12,FSandra Reid is among the people who
OL,13,Fhave reported issues with their cars
OL,14,Fafter buying fuel at the Asda branch in
OL,15,FColeraine, County Londonderry.
OL,17,FShe said her car started to "chug along
OL,18,Fand struggle to accelerate" and
OL,19,Feventually broke down, after leaving
OL,20,Fthe forecourt on the Ring Road.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
